  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Initial release\n      - Backend-for-Frontend authentication pattern\n      - OAuth 2.0/OIDC with PKCE support\n      - Keycloak provider implementation\n      - Multi-tenant role-based authorization\n      - Redis and in-memory session storage\n      - Automatic localhost redirect support in development\n      - Comprehensive logout with end-session support",
